OL,3,GNEWSAFive men arrested over courier
OL,4,Afraud scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have been arrested after
OL,7,Felderly people in Wolverhampton were
OL,8,Fscammed out of thousands of pounds by
OL,9,Ffraudsters posing as police officers.
OL,11,FThe victims, in their 80s, were called
OL,12,Fand asked to put a large sum of cash in
OL,13,Fan envelope for an 'officer' to collect
OL,14,F- with two residents, believing the
OL,15,Fscammers to be real officers, handing
OL,16,Fover a combined total of #10,000.
OL,18,FThe men, all 19-years-old, were
OL,19,Farrested from a vehicle which was
OL,20,Fstopped in London on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
